#: .\appointment\messages_.py:11
msgid "We're excited to have you on board!"
msgstr "On est ravi de vous accueillir !"

#: .\appointment\messages_.py:13
msgid ""
"We're excited to have you on board! The next step is \n"
"to pay for the booking. You have the choice to pay the whole amount or a "
"down deposit.\n"
"If you choose the deposit, you will have to pay the rest of the amount on "
"the day of the booking."
msgstr ""
"On est ravi de vous accueillir ! La prochaine étape est \n"
"de payer la réservation. Vous avez le choix de payer le montant total ou un "
"acompte.\n"
"Si vous choisissez l'acompte, vous devrez payer le reste du montant le jour "
"de la réservation."

#: .\appointment\messages_.py:17
msgid ""
"We're excited to have you on board! Thank you for booking us. The next step "
"is to pay for\n"
"the booking."
msgstr ""
"On est ravi de vous accueillir ! Merci de nous avoir réservé. La prochaine "
"étape est de payer\n"
"la réservation."

